<title>SOUTH KOREA: Honam Petrochemical '96 net narrows.</title>
<headline>Honam Petrochemical '96 net narrows.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			  649    vs 1,489</p>
<p>    Net				   20.7  vs    47.4</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 22.7  vs    63.6</p>
<p>    Turnover			   556.4  vs   553.3</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won, in cash)</p>
<p>					     7    vs    15</p>
<p>    Extraordinary	     (loss) 0.2  vs     0.8 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - South Korea's Honam Petrochemical Corp's share capital stood unchanged at 31.86 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
